sequenceDiagram
  participant User
  participant UI as Streamlit UI
  participant Agent as LangGraph Agent
  participant LLM as Gemini 2.5 Flash
  participant Web as DuckDuckGo Web
  participant News as News API
  participant DDG as DuckDuckGo News

  User->>UI: Enter query + click Research
  UI->>Agent: Start run with prompt + tools
  Agent->>LLM: Ask next step
  LLM-->>Agent: Tool call (Search_Web)
  Agent->>Web: Execute search
  Web-->>Agent: Results
  Agent->>LLM: Provide results
  LLM-->>Agent: Tool call (Search_News)
  Agent->>News: Execute news search
  News-->>Agent: Articles
  Agent->>LLM: Provide results
  LLM-->>Agent: Tool call (DDG_News)
  Agent->>DDG: Execute news search
  DDG-->>Agent: Articles
  Agent->>LLM: Provide all findings
  LLM-->>Agent: Final markdown report
  Agent->>UI: Render + export
